WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.600
Welcome to IBM CloudLabs,

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:06.240
an interactive way to learn essential cloud-native concepts

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:08.600
all entirely through your browser.

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:10.640
Whether you're an experienced developer,

00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:13.580
or just looking to learn more about Kubernetes in the cloud,

00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:16.940
IBM CloudLabs makes it easy to get started.

00:00:16.940 --> 00:00:18.740
Let's see how it works.

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:22.660
Cloud Labs gives you access to a real Kubernetes cluster environment

00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:24.120
- not a demo.

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:27.800
You'll get temporary access to a paid Kubernetes cluster

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:29.760
in an IBM Cloud account.

00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:30.920
To get started,

00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:34.320
click on the lab that you want to start with,

00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:38.900
and then take a look through the contents of that lab,

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:43.240
and then hit the "Launch Lab" button on the top right.

00:00:43.240 --> 00:00:44.800
If you're not logged in already,

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:47.900
you'll be asked to log-in or create an IBM Cloud account

00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:50.400
- this part is quick and free!

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:54.320
Following that, you'll have a fixed amount of time to run through the lab.

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:57.080
If you need more time to complete the lab,

00:00:57.080 --> 00:01:00.520
you may extend the duration by one additional hour.

00:01:00.520 --> 00:01:02.180
Here's the best part:

00:01:02.180 --> 00:01:05.560
there's no pre-req setup or tools to install,

00:01:05.560 --> 00:01:07.360
all the tools you need are embedded

00:01:07.360 --> 00:01:10.860
in the interactive terminal directly in the browser!

00:01:10.860 --> 00:01:12.720
Follow the guided lab

00:01:12.720 --> 00:01:14.340
- you can easily input commands

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:16.980
from the instructions into the terminal.

00:01:16.980 --> 00:01:19.820
Once you've completed the labs, you can take the quiz

00:01:19.820 --> 00:01:22.820
to earn a badge and show off your skills.

00:01:22.820 --> 00:01:23.920
To get started now,

00:01:23.920 --> 00:01:26.120
check out the links in the description below.

00:01:26.120 --> 00:01:27.280
Thanks for joining us,

00:01:27.280 --> 00:01:30.300
and we hope to see you on IBM Cloud Labs.

00:01:30.300 --> 00:01:33.360
As always, please drop a "like" or a comment below.

00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:34.400
Be sure to subscribe,

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:37.260
and stay tuned for more videos like this in the future.

